// Phase 3 (INTER), COMPOUND DECODE: a REFERENCE_MODE_SELECT frame with
// skip_mode present. The hierarchical-GOP compound stream (same OBU as
// inter_compound_test) at decode index 6 (order hint 4) has 5 inter blocks over
// one 64x64 superblock:
//   * three single-ref NON-SKIP blocks (BLOCK_32X32) carrying a TX_32X32 luma
//     residual + TX_16X16 chroma (NEWMV / NEWMV / NEARESTMV).
//   * one COMPOUND skip_mode block (BLOCK_16X32): skip_mode==1 -> the fixed
//     skipModeFrame pair [LAST(1), ALTREF(7)], NEAREST_NEARESTMV,
//     COMPOUND_AVERAGE, 2 MVs resolved by the compound ref-mv candidate padding
//     (process_compound_ref_mv_candidate) -> mv0=(-24,-30) mv1=(24,30).
//   * one single-ref skip block (BLOCK_16X32, NEARMV).
// Every non-skip-mode comp-ref-allowed block also reads a comp_mode
// (reference_select) flag (all SINGLE here). Ground truth: 108 od_ec symbols,
// frame-end rng == 35628 (confirmed by the SW oracle).
//
// This decodes that frame to frame-end od_ec sync bit-exact vs SW, exercising
// the new compound decode path: skip_mode + comp_mode + compound find_mv_refs
// (skip_mode block) + compound mi-grid storage (miRef1/miMv1/miSkipMode fed to
// the neighbour skip_mode / reference_mode / single_ref contexts).

